| Implicit Cursor                        | Explicit (Simple) Cursor               | Parameterised Cursor                                  |
| -------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| Oracle declares it                     | Programmer declares it                 | Programmer declares it                                |
| Oracle opens and closes it             | Programmer opens and closes it         | Programmer opens and closes it                        |
| Cannot be reused with different values | Cannot be reused with different values | Can be reused with different values                   |
| Best for a single SQL statement        | Best for a fixed query                 | Best when the same query needs different input values |
